<p id=3D"mw0w">The Sun formed approximately 4.6<span typeof=3D"mw:Entity" i=
d=3D"mw1A">&nbsp;</span>billion<sup about=3D"#mwt154" class=3D"mw-ref refer=
ence" id=3D"cite_ref-short_22-0" rel=3D"dc:references" typeof=3D"mw:Extensi=
on/ref" data-mw=3D"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&qu=
