" title=3D"Convection" id=3D"mwAgk">convective motion</a> due to heat trans=
port and the <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/C=
oriolis_force" title=3D"Coriolis force" id=3D"mwAgo">Coriolis force</a> due=
