id=3D"mwAwk">Main article: <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipe=
dia.org/wiki/Tachocline" title=3D"Tachocline">Tachocline</a></div>

<p id=3D"mwAwo">The radiative zone and the convective zone are separated by=
 a transition layer, the tachocline. This is a region where the sharp regim=
e change between the uniform rotation of the radiative zone and the differe=
ntial rotation of the <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.o=
rg/wiki/Convection_zone" title=3D"Convection zone" id=3D"mwAws">convection =
zone</a> results in a large <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikip=
edia.org/wiki/Shear_stress" title=3D"Shear stress" id=3D"mwAww">shear</a> b=
etween the two=E2=80=94a condition where successive horizontal layers slide=
 past one another.<sup about=3D"#mwt397" class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"c=
ite_ref-75" rel=3D"dc:references" typeof=3D"mw:Extension/ref" data-mw=3D"{&=
quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quo=
t;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-75&quot;}}"><a href=3D"https:/=
/en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sun#cite_note-75" id=3D"mwAw0"><span class=3D"mw-ref=
link-text" id=3D"mwAw4"><span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwAw8">[</span>7=
2<span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwAxA">]</span></span></a></sup> Presen=
tly, it is hypothesised that a magnetic dynamo, or <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" h=
ref=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solar_dynamo" title=3D"Solar dynamo" i=
d=3D"mwAxE">solar dynamo</a>, within this layer generates the Sun's <a rel=
=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magnetic_field" titl=
e=3D"Magnetic field" id=3D"mwAxI">magnetic field</a>.<sup about=3D"#mwt398"=
 class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-NASA1_64-4" rel=3D"dc:references=
" typeof=3D"mw:Extension/ref" data-mw=3D"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,=
&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;NASA1&quot;}}"><a href=3D"https:/=
/en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sun#cite_note-NASA1-64" id=3D"mwAxM"><span class=3D"=
mw-reflink-text" id=3D"mwAxQ"><span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwAxU">[</=
span>61<span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwAxY">]</span></span></a></sup><=
/p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id=3D"10" id=3D"mwAxc" aria-labelledby=
