mary layers: the photosphere, the <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en=
.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chromosphere" title=3D"Chromosphere" id=3D"mwAzQ">chrom=
osphere</a>, and the <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.or=
g/wiki/Stellar_corona" title=3D"Stellar corona" id=3D"mwAzU">corona</a>.<su=
p about=3D"#mwt412" class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-77" rel=3D"dc=
