=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwA14">]</span></span></a></sup> Conversely, the vi=
sible light perceived is produced as electrons react with hydrogen atoms to=
 produce H<sup id=3D"mwA18">=E2=88=92</sup> ions.<sup about=3D"#mwt428" cla=
ss=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-Gibson_82-0" rel=3D"dc:references" t=
