"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwBJ4">]</span></span></a></sup> Looking directly at t=
he Sun, known as <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wi=
ki/Sungazing" title=3D"Sungazing" id=3D"mwBJ8">sungazing</a>, causes <a rel=
