<p id=3D"mwBLM">Viewing the Sun through light-concentrating <a rel=3D"mw:Wi=
kiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Optics" title=3D"Optics" id=
=3D"mwBLQ">optics</a> such as <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wik=
ipedia.org/wiki/Binoculars" title=3D"Binoculars" id=3D"mwBLU">binoculars</a=
> may result in permanent damage to the retina without an appropriate filte=
r. Some improvised filters that pass UV or <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"h=
ttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Infrared" title=3D"Infrared" id=3D"mwBLY">IR</=
a> rays can harm the eye at high brightness levels.<sup about=3D"#mwt584" c=
lass=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-123" rel=3D"dc:references" typeof=
