mwBLs"><span class=3D"mw-reflink-text" id=3D"mwBLw"><span class=3D"cite-bra=
cket" id=3D"mwBL0">[</span>120<span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwBL4">]</=
span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id=3D"mwBL8">During sunrise and sunset, sunlight is attenuated because o=
f <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rayleigh_sca=
ttering" title=3D"Rayleigh scattering" id=3D"mwBMA">Rayleigh scattering</a>=
 and <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mie_scatt=
ering" title=3D"Mie scattering" id=3D"mwBME">Mie scattering</a> from a part=
icularly long passage through Earth's atmosphere,<sup about=3D"#mwt590" cla=
ss=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-Haber2005_125-0" rel=3D"dc:reference=
s" typeof=3D"mw:Extension/ref" data-mw=3D"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;=
