&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-short-22&quot;}}"><a href=3D"https://en.w=
ikipedia.org/wiki/Sun#cite_note-short-22" data-mw-group=3D"lower-alpha" id=
=3D"mwBas"><span class=3D"mw-reflink-text" id=3D"mwBaw"><span class=3D"cite=
-bracket" id=3D"mwBa0">[</span>a<span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwBa4">]=
</span></span></a></sup> years and will remain fairly stable for about five=
 billion more. However, after hydrogen fusion in its core has stopped, the =
Sun will undergo dramatic changes, both internally and externally.</p>

