<p id=3D"mwBbI">The Sun formed about 4.6<span typeof=3D"mw:Entity" id=3D"mw=
BbM">&nbsp;</span>billion years ago from the collapse of part of a giant <a=
 rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Molecular_cloud"=
