mostly of hydrogen and helium and that probably gave birth to many other st=
ars.<!-- We would say 4.57, but there may be uncertainty; for example, http=
s://arxiv.org/pdf/1507.05847.pdf seems to suggest 4.587 rather than 4.567 -=
-><sup about=3D"#mwt689" class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-Zirker20=
