aft)" id=3D"mwBfY">Gaia</a></i> space observatory mission in 2022.<sup abou=
t=3D"#mwt716" class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-157" rel=3D"dc:refe=
rences" typeof=3D"mw:Extension/ref" data-mw=3D"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&=
