<p id=3D"mwBss">The Sun is moved by the gravitational pull of the planets. =
The centre of the Sun moves around the Solar System <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" =
href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barycentre" title=3D"Barycentre" clas=
s=3D"mw-redirect" id=3D"mwBsw">barycentre</a>, within a range from 0.1 to 2=
.2 solar radii. The Sun's motion around the barycentre approximately repeat=
s every 179<span typeof=3D"mw:Entity" id=3D"mwBs0">&nbsp;</span>years, rota=
