ttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Synodic_period" title=3D"Synodic period" class=
=3D"mw-redirect" id=3D"mwBs4">synodic period</a> of Jupiter and Saturn.<sup=
 about=3D"#mwt800" class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-177" rel=3D"dc=
:references" typeof=3D"mw:Extension/ref" data-mw=3D"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot=
;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-r=
