ss=3D"mw-reflink-text" id=3D"mwBtY"><span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwBt=
c">[</span>174<span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwBtg">]</span></span></a>=
</sup> After 179 years (nine times the synodic period of Jupiter and Saturn=
), the pattern more or less repeats, but rotated by about 24=C2=B0.<sup abo=
ut=3D"#mwt806" class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-179" rel=3D"dc:ref=
erences" typeof=3D"mw:Extension/ref" data-mw=3D"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref=
