<p>Groups of stars form together in <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://=
en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Star_cluster" title=3D"Star cluster">star clusters</a=
>, before dissolving into co-moving associations. A prominent grouping that=
