en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ursa_Major_moving_group" title=3D"Ursa Major moving g=
roup">Ursa Major moving group</a>, which is around 80 light-years away with=
in the Local Bubble. The nearest star cluster is <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" hre=
