star cluster)">Hyades</a>, which lies at the edge of the Local Bubble. The =
closest star-forming regions are the <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https:/=
/en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Corona_Australis_Molecular_Cloud" title=3D"Corona Au=
stralis Molecular Cloud">Corona Australis Molecular Cloud</a>, the <a rel=
