omplex" title=3D"Rho Ophiuchi cloud complex">Rho Ophiuchi cloud complex</a>=
 and the <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tauru=
s_molecular_cloud" title=3D"Taurus molecular cloud">Taurus molecular cloud<=
/a>; the latter lies just beyond the Local Bubble and is part of the Radcli=
ffe wave.<sup about=3D"#mwt865" class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-1=
