cs</a> for more details.)</span></p>

<p id=3D"mwB2M">The Sun's orbit around the Milky Way is perturbed due to th=
e non-uniform mass distribution in Milky Way, such as that in and between t=
he galactic spiral arms. However, it is statistically unlikely that the Sun=
 has migrated very far radially from its birth radius within the galaxy.<su=
