 id=3D"mwB_E">[</span>213<span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwB_I">]</span>=
</span></a></sup> In modern heliocentric terms, this is caused by a gradual=
 motion of the aphelion of the <em id=3D"mwB_M">Earth's</em> orbit. <a rel=
