ps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ibn_Sina" title=3D"Ibn Sina" class=3D"mw-redirec=
t" id=3D"mwCAc">Ibn Sina</a> concluded that Venus was closer to Earth than =
the Sun.<sup about=3D"#mwt973" class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-Go=
