e=3D"Trigonometry" id=3D"mwCA4">trigonometrically</a> determine the distanc=
es between Earth, <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/w=
iki/Venus" title=3D"Venus" id=3D"mwCA8">Venus</a>, and the Sun.<sup about=
