span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwCBI">[</span>217<span class=3D"cite-bra=
cket" id=3D"mwCBM">]</span></span></a></sup> Observations of the <a rel=3D"=
mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1769_transit_of_Venus_ob=
served_from_Tahiti" title=3D"1769 transit of Venus observed from Tahiti" id=
