h von Fraunhofer" id=3D"mwCCs">Joseph von Fraunhofer</a> recorded more than=
 600 <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Absorptio=
n_lines" title=3D"Absorption lines" class=3D"mw-redirect" id=3D"mwCCw">abso=
