ferred to as <i id=3D"mwCC0"><a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wiki=
pedia.org/wiki/Fraunhofer_lines" title=3D"Fraunhofer lines" id=3D"mwCC4">Fr=
