systems for observing the Sun, especially at different narrowband wavelengt=
hs, such as those using Calcium-H (396.9<span typeof=3D"mw:Entity" id=3D"mw=
CC8">&nbsp;</span>nm), Calcium-K (393.37<span typeof=3D"mw:Entity" id=3D"mw=
CDA">&nbsp;</span>nm) and <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikiped=
ia.org/wiki/Hydrogen-alpha" title=3D"Hydrogen-alpha" id=3D"mwCDE">Hydrogen-=
alpha</a> (656.46<span typeof=3D"mw:Entity" id=3D"mwCDI">&nbsp;</span>nm) <=
a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astronomical_fi=
lter" title=3D"Astronomical filter" id=3D"mwCDM">filtering</a>.<sup about=
=3D"#mwt988" class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-225" rel=3D"dc:refer=
ences" typeof=3D"mw:Extension/ref" data-mw=3D"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&q=
uot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-referen=
ce-text-cite_note-225&quot;}}"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sun=
