lvin</a> suggested that the Sun is a gradually cooling liquid body that is =
radiating an internal store of heat.<sup about=3D"#mwt994" class=3D"mw-ref =
reference" id=3D"cite_ref-kelvin_227-0" rel=3D"dc:references" typeof=3D"mw:=
